1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,809
A measurable cup to disc ratio can still come from the wrong structure.

2
00:00:04,809 --> 00:00:12,462
HyunOptic joins two model outputs, unresolved decisions, and evidence
export in one local research session.

3
00:00:12,462 --> 00:00:18,410
This demonstration uses synthetic images and two small models trained on
the CPU.

4
00:00:18,410 --> 00:00:24,309
These are actual application captures, with edited timing and synthetic
narration.

5
00:00:24,309 --> 00:00:29,752
The public preparation command has already trained both models for
eighty epochs.

6
00:00:29,752 --> 00:00:35,416
Seed forty three is the primary model; seed forty two is the comparison.

7
00:00:35,416 --> 00:00:41,709
I import four synthetic images and one deliberately unreadable file
through the real file chooser.

8
00:00:41,709 --> 00:00:46,209
Local retention is confirmed before I create the session.

9
00:00:46,209 --> 00:00:50,943
Processing runs in a bounded step and saves each completed input.

10
00:00:50,943 --> 00:00:56,741
The result is four completed images, eight predictions, and one retained
input error.

11
00:00:56,741 --> 00:01:03,199
Unreadable data receives a terminal explanation, without a retry that
cannot repair the file.

12
00:01:03,199 --> 00:01:07,998
The source and both model overlays share the same image coordinates.

13
00:01:07,998 --> 00:01:12,498
Model identities remain attached to their outputs.

14
00:01:12,498 --> 00:01:19,041
The boundaries and predicted ratios differ; disagreement is not a
calibrated confidence score.

15
00:01:19,041 --> 00:01:23,541
Both models can agree and still be wrong.

16
00:01:23,541 --> 00:01:28,041
I mark the first case held and choose the reason uncertain.

17
00:01:28,041 --> 00:01:34,224
Save and next stores that decision, then opens the next unreviewed case
in the current order.

18
00:01:34,224 --> 00:01:40,308
After a full browser reload, reopening the original case restores held
and uncertain.

19
00:01:40,308 --> 00:01:46,371
Keyboard Tab navigation reaches the review controls, and Enter saves
without a mouse.

20
00:01:46,371 --> 00:01:50,980
The same workflow offers a full size panel on narrow screens.

21
00:01:50,980 --> 00:01:55,518
A real three hundred ninety pixel check found a compressed header.

22
00:01:55,518 --> 00:02:00,112
The updated layout moves readable status cards below the brand.

23
00:02:00,112 --> 00:02:05,271
These checks do not constitute a complete accessibility certification.

24
00:02:05,271 --> 00:02:09,771
I build the evidence package and download that verified ZIP.

25
00:02:09,771 --> 00:02:14,859
A separate checker accepts its six payloads and confirms the held
decision.

26
00:02:14,859 --> 00:02:22,103
Original images, masks, filenames, paths, and private notes are
excluded.

27
00:02:22,103 --> 00:02:27,501
Hashes establish consistency, not anonymity or scientific truth.

28
00:02:27,501 --> 00:02:34,814
The repository provides a synthetic setup, reproducible checks, and
research evidence with explicit limits.

29
00:02:34,814 --> 00:02:41,587
All changes shown were prepared before the hackathon; later event work
must be disclosed separately.

30
00:02:41,587 --> 00:02:47,371
HyunOptic is research software, not a diagnostic or patient care tool.
